you made last time! I would like to ask for a reference sheet (character design reference) or an image! If it is too time-consuming or difficult, please feel free to cancel it!\n\n■ Characters\nhttps://sta.sh/21xfgdk0kjta\n\n■ Clothing\nFor the image, https://i.imgur.com/GZ8kQBQ.png ! \nFor the reference sheet, the same maid outfit is fine!\n\n■Pose\nReference Sheet: I would like a front view, a back view, and a side view! It would be for my own personal use!\nImage: Any pose is fine! I'd like something cat-like though.\n\nIf possible, delivery should be in PSD.\nIf possible, I would like the address on a separate layer and a transparent version of the character (put the character on a separate layer).\nIf you find it difficult to accept, you may cancel at any time.\n\nhttps://sta.sh/21xfgdk0kjta", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@vivivivi0808/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/865fc040/uploads/origins/a2f6148e-724c-415b-b897-2618d64b0007?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=51244a0eeed097bb8b266eefcb910205", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/865fc040/uploads/origins/a2f6148e-724c-415b-b897-2618d64b0007?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=51244a0eeed097bb8b266eefcb910205, https://si.imgix.net/865fc040/uploads/origins/a2f6148e-724c-415b-b897-2618d64b0007?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91ccc783251485d83a873daa49a1841f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/865fc040/uploads/origins/a2f6148e-724c-415b-b897-2618d64b0007?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8904ab61f541dba4bf61ce2613dd1da 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "私のオリジナルキャラクター、バイオレットを描いてください\n\n構図などは自由ですので、ご自由に描いてください\n\nありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://twitter.com/ac8231/status/1498290776777756673?s=20&t=K4CFeu43QBVwL8EoEWnvxA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@vivivivi0808/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "http